WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.330
"Hurry up!" Harry told his family.

2
00:00:08.331 --> 00:00:17.847
"I can't be late for my school play."

3
00:00:17.848 --> 00:00:26.350
They were still getting ready.

4
00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:32.104
At last everyone ran out to the car.

5
00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:37.340
"Wait for me!" cried Aunt Judy.

6
00:00:37.341 --> 00:00:41.307
Dad drove down the street.

7
00:00:41.308 --> 00:00:45.385
"Did you remember the tickets?" asked Mom.

8
00:00:45.386 --> 00:00:51.877
"Whoops," said Dad.

9
00:00:51.878 --> 00:00:56.998
Dad turned the car around and drove back home.

10
00:00:56.999 --> 00:01:03.593
Dad ran into the house.

11
00:01:03.594 --> 00:01:10.070
Oliver cried, "I have to go to the bathroom!"

12
00:01:10.071 --> 00:01:17.050
"Let's go," said Mom.

13
00:01:17.051 --> 00:01:23.861
"Hurry!" said Harry.

14
00:01:23.862 --> 00:01:31.881
Mom, Dad, and Oliver were back soon.

15
00:01:31.882 --> 00:01:35.626
They were almost at the school when Harry gasped.

16
00:01:35.627 --> 00:01:43.624
"I forgot my turtle costume!" he said.

17
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.414
Dad stopped the car and turned around.

18
00:01:47.415 --> 00:01:52.692
Mom ran into the house for the costume.

19
00:01:52.693 --> 00:01:58.179
"Did anyone else forget anything?" Dad asked.

20
00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:02.712
Oliver and Emmy shook their heads.

21
00:02:02.713 --> 00:02:07.179
"Not me," said Aunt Judy.

22
00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:11.363
Mom got back in the car.

23
00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:19.865
"Okay, let's go," she said, looking at her watch.

24
00:02:19.866 --> 00:02:24.879
Soon they were at the school.

25
00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:29.062
"Have fun, Harry," said Mom.

26
00:02:29.063 --> 00:02:32.581
Harry went backstage.

27
00:02:32.582 --> 00:02:43.948
The rest of the family went to their seats.

28
00:02:43.949 --> 00:02:52.372
A minute later the play started.

29
00:02:52.373 --> 00:02:57.110
"Oh, Harry looks adorable," said Mom.

30
00:02:57.111 --> 00:03:01.612
"Honey, take some pictures.

31
00:03:01.613 --> 00:03:05.132
"Uh-oh," said Dad.

32
00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:08.040
"What's wrong?" asked Mom.

33
00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:14.646
I forgot the camera, said Dad.

